{"projectInfo":{"name":"静态路由与BFD联动（直连）配置举例","path":"bfd","visibility":2,"categoryId":37,"introduction":"在Router A上配置静态路由可以到达120.1.1.0/24网段，在Router B上配置静态路由可以到达121.1.1.0/24网段，并使能BFD检测功能。在Router C上配置静态路由可以到达120.1.1.0/24网段和121.1.1.0/24网段。当Router A和Router B通过L2 Switch通信的链路出现故障时，BFD能够快速感知，并且切换到Router C进行通信。","label":["静态路由","BFD"]},"deviceInfoList":[{"resourceName":"L2-Switch","resourceCategory":"交换机","resourceModel":"S5820V2-54QS-GE","resourceVersion":"CMW7.1.075-A7571","configPath":"DeviceConfig\\L2-Switch.cfg"},{"resourceName":"RouterB","resourceCategory":"路由器","resourceModel":"MSR36-20","resourceVersion":"CMW7.1.064-R0821P11","configPath":"DeviceConfig\\RouterB.cfg"},{"resourceName":"RouterC","resourceCategory":"路由器","resourceModel":"MSR36-20","resourceVersion":"CMW7.1.064-R0821P11","configPath":"DeviceConfig\\RouterC.cfg"},{"resourceName":"RouterA","resourceCategory":"路由器","resourceModel":"MSR36-20","resourceVersion":"CMW7.1.064-R0821P11","configPath":"DeviceConfig\\RouterA.cfg"}]}